! 25-MAR-2014, Y. Nosochkov
!  * add insertable beam stoppers STSP6ha, STSP6hb, STSP6hc in HXR
! 07-MAR-2014, Y. Nosochkov
!  * move corrector YCSP8h upstream of quad QSP8h for better separation with
